        "body": "<p>We believe skincare works best when it’s simple enough to stick to.</p><p>Oladerm is built around easy, intentional routines that focus on what truly matters cleanse, hydrate, protect, repair. No 10-step regimens. No skin-shaming. No pressure.</p><p>Our formulas are gentle, effective, and thoughtfully balanced designed to support the skin barrier, respect sensitivity, and deliver visible results over time.</p><p>Because consistency is powerful.<br/><br/>And when skincare feels calm, your skin responds in kind.</p>",
